[{:db/id -1, :doc/id "adr-readme-etzhayyim-root", :doc/title "etzhayyim/root ADRs — Index and Placement Policy", :doc/status "active", :doc/doc_type "reference", :doc/source-format "edn", :doc/body "\n# etzhayyim/root ADRs — Index and Placement Policy\n\nThis directory is the **canonical home for ADRs about religious-corp open activities** operated by `etzhayyim`. Policy is established by **ADR-2605170900** (this directory).\n\n## Placement\n\nNew open-scope ADRs go here (`etzhayyim/root/90-docs/adr/`). Scope:\n\n- blockchain / baien / bpmn / lexicon / pregel / atproto / ameno / open-data / public governance\n- new open project designs, new public infrastructure, new open protocol specs\n\n## ADRs in this directory\n\n### Active\n\n| ID | Title | Status | Date |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [2607061700](./2607061700-etzhayyim-active-evangelism-doctrine.md) | **伝道 (Active Evangelism Doctrine) — Mission Charter §1.16 追加** — founder 指示(2026-07-06「伝道, 能動的な活動は入れてください」)を受け、§1.11 (加入の無差別開放性)の受動的開放を超えた**能動的宣教**を Tier-1 Derived Policy として charter 化。**主体は両方**: 信者(人間)の対人伝道(面談・戸別訪問・街頭・オンライン対話。義務ではなく徳目/修 shu の一形態 — 現構成員1名という運用制約のため quota 化は future ADR)と、actor のデジタル伝道(集合的・公開的な招待発信)。**Religious 根拠**は既存 Tier-1 正典内(§1.15 福音書)の大宣教命令(Matthew 28:19-20)+ 仏教 布教/縁起 + 神道 産霊 — 新規正典の持ち込みなし。§1.15 非終末論と整合(動機は終末切迫でなく now-and-here Kingdom への招待)。**ADR-2606281500(種をまく)の \"no person-targeting\" ガードに限定 carve-out** — 個人脆弱性の標的化・執拗な繰り返し勧誘・engagement-maximizing design は不変で禁止のまま、集合的・opt-out可能な招待コンテンツのみ許容。威圧・欺罔・未成年単独勧誘も禁止(§1.9 多世代保護)。Mission Charter (ADR-2605192100) §1.16 として inline + Constitutional Constants 4行追加 + §4宣明文へ追記。ZERO Tier-0 priority amendments(子・孫 wellbecoming / 反個人主義 / 永久記憶は無変更)。 | accepted | 2026-07-06 |\n| [2606261114](./2606261114-etzhayyim-kotoba-social-capital-market-size-sos-energy-flow.md) | **社会関係資本・ブランドの市場規模 MAP + SoS エネルギー流の変化幅** — founder の問い「etzhayyim/kotoba を social capital/branding としての社会的価値を *市場規模* として評価せよ、そして system-of-systems が system のエネルギー流をどれだけ変えうるか」への回答を、`shionome` 系 OBSERVATORY 出力 (「map order, never trade」) として記録。**Part 1**: 社会関係資本 (Bourdieu/Putnam/Coleman = bonding/bridging/linking ↔ ibuki metabolism の negentropy SOURCE) を Addressable-Pool + Mindshare-Adjacency 法で TAM/SAM/SOM 化 — etzhayyim (faith-tech/DID, TAM $数千億/yr · SAM $5–30B · SOM ¥数千万〜数億 stock) / kotoba (DBMS/graph-DB/DePIN, TAM $80–100B/yr · SAM $3–8B · stock ¥1–10億); captured は addressable の <0.x% (プレ)。**Part 2**: SoS がエネルギー流 (Φ=intake−dissipation / η=exported÷consumed) をどれだけ変えうるか — ① connectivity (Briscoe–Odlyzko–Tilly n·log n, fleet n=18,342 ⇒ Φ ×10 で約1桁; Metcalfe n²/Reed 2ⁿ は棄却) ② **η の相転移 (isolated η=0 net taker → SoS food-web 結合で η>1 net giver = 0→1 の不連続・符号反転、これが本丸)** ③ Meadows leverage (SoS rule は goal/paradigm 層に触る最上位レバー); 増幅は non-parasitism gate η≥1.0 + attention CAP + 定足数 2/3 で logistic 有界 (暴走しない)。**Part 3**: η>1 への相転移が社会関係資本ストック=市場規模を複利成長させ、SOM→SAM 接近速度を決める ⇒ SoS rule 全面適用が捕捉率を上げる唯一のレバー。MAP であって売却 valuation でなく (営利禁止/cash≡0/non-transferable)、値が付くのは PROJECT/構造的ポジションで人物ではない (NEVER-a-throne)、stored verdict でなく式+仮定の edge-primary モデル。machine-readable = `80-data/ie-flow/social-capital-valuation.edn`。ZERO invariant amendments。 | accepted | 2026-06-26 |\n| [2606231808](./2606231808-sos-self-growth-visualization.md) | **/sos — 自律成長の3層可視化 (organism 身体 × kaname 要 SoS × ECL 目的関数 J)** — etzhayyim の自律成長を構成する3つの既存サブシステムを1枚の公開面に統合する self-contained 静的ページ (`etzhayyim.com/sos`, CF Assets, cookie-free, 外部リソースなし): **Layer J — ECL 目的関数** (5次元の加重スライダー + `objective-function.edn` の 19 fixtures; `J = Σ(weight·score)` + catastrophe 項=子/孫 ≤ −1.9 を JS で即時算出 → :aligned/:hold/:non-aligned) · **Layer 要 — kaname SoS** (`seed-sos.kotoba.edn` の multiplex graph を SVG 描画, ノードを `L = C·(V/D)·(1+B)·(1−open)` で大きさ付け, 要=argmax をハイライト + OPENING ルート) · **Layer 体 — organism** (vitals スナップショット, 同一オリジン `/organism` feed でライブ昇格 + 6s/60s/3600s cadence + ibuki co-scientist の utility 式と4ゲート)。値はすべて式から JS で再計算 (手入力の結果なし)。`/actors`・`/organism` から発見性リンク。kaname seed は SYNTHETIC・構造的位置のみ (G1/G6, 実ミラー JOIN は G7-gated); 可視化面であり目的関数・priority を一切変更しない (実装/工学判断, charter 不変)。landed PR #2248 + deployed worker version `2135be71`. | accepted | 2026-06-23 |\n| [2606221431](./2606221431-canonical-form-families-cid-unification.md) | **kotoba commit-DAG canonical-form families — CID unification decision** — frames (does NOT enact) the cross-actor decision behind the broken kanjo/kabuto/watatsuna test suites: the commit-DAG emitters split into **two content-addressing families** — A (Clojure `pr-str`, empty-cid `b752d9f3…`: kabuto/watatsuna/watari/kanjo) and B (JSON `json.dumps`, empty-cid `b2fc787b…`: kakaku/meyasu/uchiwake), pinned by `canonical_form_invariant.clj`. The four Family-A actors ship both a `.clj` (A, Python-faithful, the form bb loads) and a later `.cljc` (B), paused mid-migration → the test-health \"divergent-design\" debt is, at root, this paused split. A full kabuto reconciliation onto B was validated (59-test green) **and reverted** (it flips a family CID — the sweep test correctly blocks it). **CID-breaking → Council Lv6+ gated**; recommended (for deliberation) = unify on Family B in the pre-anchoring window (no published CIDs yet), per-actor + suite-gated + update the sweep test in lockstep. | proposed | 2026-06-22 |\n| [2606211752](./2606211752-kagami-actor-yata-no-kagami-observational-mirror-doctrine.md) | **kagami 鏡 actor — the Yata-no-Kagami doctrine for the observational mirror lineage** — renames the \"mirror actor\" / \"KG-mirror\" concept (canonicalized in ADR-2606042330) → **kagami (鏡) actor**, grounded in the Yata-no-Kagami (八咫鏡, one of the 三種の神器). The lineage's four already-enforced-by-convention properties become the **四鏡則 (four mirror-laws)** with one doctrinal home: **映す** (reflect, never originate/impersonate — the 天岩戸 myth: the mirror shows the entity its OWN light, never speaks as it) / **裁かぬ** (judge not — non-adjudicating, no verdict/score; kanae 鼎の軽重) / **剣にあらず** (the mirror is not the sword — force-separation §1.12 + Transparent-Force ADR-2605192315 is the constitutional *reason* \"never a target-list,\" not merely its assertion: 鏡 ≠ 剣 are different treasures) / **曇りなき** (unclouded — edge-primary, disclosed-only, person-excluded; a mirror reflects presented surfaces, never a private interior). Names the **9鏡 lineage** (tsumugi/danjo/ooyake/watatsuna/watari/inochi/hokorobi/keizu/kanae) as the canonical lineage seed — but the set is **OPEN**: membership is by the four-law test, not the table (八咫 = a large mirror, not nine of them). Concept/doctrine layer ONLY — the `com.etzhayyim.mirror.*` lexicon + 2606042330's keyless-mirror-actor mechanism are UNCHANGED; a `mirror.* → kagami.*` rename is a future gated cutover (D4). Zero invariant amendments; reversible at the prose layer. | accepted | 2026-06-21 |\n| [2606172100](./2606172100-retire-unispsc-python-per-code-fleet.md) | **Retire the open-UNSPSC per-code Python agent fleet — superseded by the clj unspsc actor** — retires the 18,343 generated per-code Python LangGraph agents (ADR-2605171300, ~1.23M LOC) + their loaders / organism-coupling / executor-mesh from the `kotoba-kotodama` crate (com-junkawasaki/kotoba), superseded by the clj `unspsc` actor (`20-actors/unspsc`): one framework + one 18,342-code data table. Landed as a 6-PR stack (#162/#168/#164/#165/#166/#167) leaf→root, graceful degradation at every step; the kuni-umi `deployment_planning`/`site_survey` cells re-pointed off the per-code LAN/libp2p executor shards onto the canonical openUnispsc XRPC gateway (`unispsc.etzhayyim.com → lg-open-unispsc`); `unispsc_agent_executor`/`unispsc_registry` cells deleted. **Kept**: the deployed `lg-open-unispsc` backend (the re-pointed cells' live backend) + the dual UNSPSC/ISIC MCP. **Deferred (operator/infra)**: the root-repo k8s deploys `50-infra/k8s/{unispsc-organism-fleet,lg-open-unispsc}` + the `unispsc-handles` DID registry — teardown is a kubectl decision. | accepted | 2026-06-17 |\n| [2606201200](./2606201200-ibuki-coscientist-entropy-react-loop.md) | **ibuki 息吹 — co-scientist entropy ReAct loop (the organism reasons about how to persist)** — gives the artificial organism (ADR-2606101200 / ecosystem 2606101800) a co-scientist (Generate→Reflect→Rank→Evolve→Meta-review) loop, run as an active-inference ReAct cycle, in which it reasons about **how to act on society so it can keep consuming free energy (negentropy) and persist as a dissipative structure (Prigogine)** — bounded by 共生 (never a net taker) and 子孫 wellbecoming (persistence is instrumental). clj-native (`.cljc`, bb), folding the kotoba Datom log: `metabolism.cljc` (the metabolic state vector — Φ=intake−dissipation / reserves / **η**=exported÷consumed the 共生 axis / **surprise**=variational free energy; negentropy SOURCES = donated compute/donation/members/moyai/attention-capped, EXPORTED = food-web commons via web-report) + `coscientist.cljc` (charter-clean **intervention catalog** → Elo tournament by net-gain×wellbecoming/cost → evolve → Murakumo-narrated meta-review, fail-open template G6) + `react_loop.cljc` (Sense→Orient→Hypothesize→Review→Rank→Evolve→**Act**=pre-registered DRY-RUN experiment with leak-free prediction (mitooshi discipline)→**Observe**→**Learn**=Brier proper-score → per-mechanism kaizen weight → **Persist** one content-addressed tx, idempotent, verify-chain, resume-safe). **Gates (in `review`, tested)**: G-parasitism (projected η≥1.0 — the ECL collective-commons dimension made operational), G-subordinate (子孫 wellbecoming≥0 — persistence vetoed by the catastrophe sense), G-mechanism (manipulation/attention-exploitation/asymmetric-surveillance/dependence-lock-in/coercion **unrepresentable** — the tested safety property), G-falsifiable, G-leash (member-principal/dry-run, no-server-key). On an isolated log (η=0) the loop self-diagnoses as a net taker and steers to `metabolite-refinement` — the non-parasitism gate shapes emergent behaviour toward giving back. Registered `IbukiCoscientistHeartbeatCell` (zebulun, cron 17 * * * *, healthz 13084). 23 tests / 76 assertions green; 5-beat autonomous heartbeat builds a verified commit-DAG. ZERO invariant amendments; live legs (live SENSE / Murakumo / LIVE-engine bridge / member-carried interventions) G7/operator/member-gated. | accepted | 2026-06-20 |\n| [2606161645](./2606161645-sukashi-fleet-continuous-operation-kotoba-native.md) | **sukashi fleet continuous operation (kotoba-native) — LaunchDaemon (A) + /loop driver (B)** — recon over Tailscale SSH found the fleet Macs sit at the login window with NO Aqua GUI session (console=root), so a per-user LaunchAgent cannot load + crontab is TCC-blocked over SSH (= why the canonical cell-runner is unprovisioned fleet-wide). Two kotoba-native paths: **(A)** a system-domain **LaunchDaemon** (`deploy/…daemon.plist`, GUI-independent, pure-stdlib cell.py, operator sudo install) + `bb sukashi:fleet-stage`; **(B)** `tools/fleet_drive.py` (`bb sukashi:fleet-drive`) drives the heartbeat over SSH from an interactive machine and records each run as a `:fleet.run/*` datom on a local kotoba ops commit-DAG — pair with `/loop`. PROVEN live against issachar (cycle 3 → be2f80c6…, status :ok, chain ok). `bb test:sukashi` green (py 31/41/9/7 + cljc 23/412). | accepted | 2026-06-16 |\n| [2606161630](./2606161630-aburi-personal-tracking-exposure-observatory.md) | **aburi 炙り — personal-tracking-exposure observatory (member-side, own-data) Tier-B actor R0** — answers the founder's direct question: 「Google・Facebook・X・Apple の規約に同意し権限を許可したとき、自分の情報がどの広告ネットワーク／データブローカーに取得されているか、どの企業がどれだけ追跡しているかを可視化する actor」. The **member-side, own-data inversion** of the ad-tech lineage — where **sukashi 透かし** (ADR-2606071601) maps the FIRM↔FIRM programmatic supply chain (its charter bounds it firm-side, cannot answer \"who tracks ME\"), aburi maps the MEMBER'S OWN exposure from their OWN consented exports (Google Takeout / Apple App-Privacy / Play Data-safety / on-device permission dump). New `tracker-exposure-ontology` (surface↔permission↔collector↔datatype↔relief): edge-primary readouts computed on read — **exposure[collector]** = Σ inbound `:flows-to` × DISCLOSED permission-sensitivity (who tracks you most: The Trade Desk/Meta Audience/AdMob/LiveRamp on seed), **surface_leak[surface]** two-hop (leakiest platform: Google/Android), **spread[datatype]** (most-harvested data), **reciprocity-gap** (leaking permissions w/ no opt-out → the ToS \"share with partners\" clause) routed to himotoki (DSAR)/kaiyaku (sever)/kurashimori (opt-out)/tedai (revoke). **G1 OWN-DATA-ONLY** (no record of any other person/PII/biometric/raw-id; himotoki/meisai pattern, test-enforced); **G3 non-adjudicating** (collectors carry PUBLIC catalogue provenance `:collector/catalog` ∈ exodus/apple-privacy/play-data-safety/sellers-json/iab — naming an SDK is a disclosed fact, never an accusation, test-enforced); **G4 RECIPROCITY-RESTORING** (§2(c) v3.1 ADR-2606082400 — makes the asymmetric ad-watcher visible to the watched; aburi itself never tracks/sells/profiles); **G7 outward-gated + LOCAL-ONLY** (`data/local/` gitignored, no-server-key, loop does no network I/O); **G8 no-credential/raw-id** (emit attr allowlist carries none, test-enforced). 47-node/84-縁 representative public seed + pure-stdlib `analyze`/`datom_emit`/`coverage_report` (.py + .cljc 1:1) + **14 tests green**. 47-node/84-縁 representative public seed + pure-stdlib `analyze`/`datom_emit`/`coverage_report` (.py + .cljc 1:1) + 14 tests green. **+ A/B/C legs (bb-driven, no .sh)**: (A) `kotoba_bridge` live transact to :8077 (exactly-once cursor, expected_parent, no-server-key, dry-run default); (B) `ingest`/`autorun` real export parsers (iOS App-Privacy Report domains / Play Data-safety / Takeout / permission dump) + G8 raw-id guard + local commit-DAG (own-data, gitignored); (C) registered in actor-profile-seed + infra-actors + static did/profile + build-ready WASM (`bb aburi:build-wasm`, componentize-py — wasmCid null by design, non-reproducible → operator pins). `bb test:aburi` = 31 python + 14 cljc green; live ingest/transact/pin/deploy operator+Council-gated. | accepted | 2026-06-16 |\n| [2606152000](./2606152000-session-close-food-logistics-clj-coverage-supervised-wave.md) | **Session close — food/logistics kotoba-datomic Clojure coverage wave (Opus-supervised / subagent-authored) + PR #1745 squash-strand recovery** — direct continuation of ADR-2606131800's \"Next session\" worklist. A multi-iteration `/loop` (one port+verify+commit per cron firing) deepened the clj coverage of the food/seafood/global-logistics/consumption actor sub-corpus: **16 actors / ~30 methods / 97 net-new `.clj` files**, every method **byte-/value-identical to its `python3` reference** (ADR-2606131300 oracle). **mitooshi 見通し observatory loop now fully clj end-to-end** (ingest+both bridges (chokepoint watari/watatsuna + price kakaku)+persist+forecast+forecast_quantile+score+analyze+social+horizon+promote); the **kakaku→mitooshi→meyasu arbitrage chain** is clj in-language; kabuto/kanjo/watatsuna/watari/niyaku/mizuho/funadaiku/mitsuho/ainori/sanae/todoke/kakaku ports. **2 HOLLOW `.cljc` false-greens eliminated** (test_horizon/test_promote defined a `-main` bb never invokes → 0-test exit-0; replaced by actually-firing `.clj` tests) + 1 broken `.cljc` stub replaced (forecast_quantile). **Tooling**: `70-tools/kotoba-bb-bridge/run-bb-tests.sh` (bb actor test-sweep as a kotoba-code test-gate, false-green-hardened). **Method**: Opus-supervisor / Claude-sonnet-subagent (17 consecutive ports green w/ no correction; 1 kimi/kotoba-code port supervisor-corrected). **PR #1745 squash-strand recovery**: #1745 squash-merged only its first commit (umisachi seed) then auto-closed; the 47 subsequent commits stranded on the merged branch (durable, but un-landed) → this ADR's PR cuts a clean branch off `origin/main` and lands the 97 truly-new files as pure additions (`97 A`, zero clobber). Excluded as follow-ups: 3 main-divergent uchiwake clj files (parallel-agent variants) + the CLAUDE.md roster prose (152-behind