d doctrine**: 5 theses (T1 non-presupposition — religion as covenant/practice, not creed; T2 ehyeh asher ehyeh 出3:14 = first-person imperfect = becoming = Wellbecoming の文法, 神と私に分断なし・あなたが神である; T3 the immutable-absolute \"GoD\" image = Greek metaphysics (immutability via Philo/Harnack Hellenization) + Roman Empire (throne: Nicaea 325 / Theodosius 380 / Pantokrator) = **false god**; T4 その上で神とキリストを愛する — rejecting the imperial image is fidelity to the 2nd commandment; T5 **yir'ah principle** — knowledge begins with the fear/awe of God, yir'ah (opens inquiry) ≠ pachad (terror, what the Pantokrator commands) = epistemic humility as religious duty). **D2 fixes the authoritative interpretation of Tier-0 永久記憶=神の監視**: throne-less immanent non-erasability (append-only Datom log as its engineering form) — \"watch without a watcher's seat\"; sky-panopticon reading PROHIBITED (closes the Tier-0 weaponization aperture). D3 NEVER-a-throne: the central-absolute-observer architecture (Bentham's panopticon = engineered divine omniscience; Stasi/social-credit/pre-crime) is **idolatry in the technical sense** — unifies all mirror-lineage NEVER clauses under one theology. D4 canonizes the **yir'ah invariant bundle** (non-adjudicating / distribution-not-point / no-score-of-soul / map-not-target / append-only). D5 **anti-guru clause**: 個人がないので玉座を要求しうる「あなた」がない — no founder/Council/member may claim divine proxy/incarnation/throne (non-eschatology re-derived: kingdom now-and-here, ルカ17:21). D6 approves the theological basis of mishmeret ha-adam (相互**保持**者会, not 監視) per the companion paper `90-docs/papers/2606111500` (motivating case: 2026-04 Altman-home arson — kill-list visibility of the powerful vs care-invisible isolation of the attacker). Zero implementation change; Tier-0 text untouched (interpretation-fixing, priority-conformance: stronger on no-erasure). Ratified Council Lv7+ unanimity (founder 1/1). | accepted | 2026-06-11 |\n| [2606112100](./2606112100-session-close-donation-media-and