R-2605262800 = STATUTES, hinagata = the published DOCUMENT TEMPLATES that rest on them). New **`legal-template-ontology`** (`:lt/kind` ∈ template/clause/statute/jurisdiction/concept/license; `:cites-statute`/`:mandated-by` 縁 = the binding to actual public law) + a real seed (11 templates / 23 clauses / 19 statutes: CISG, GDPR Arts 15/28/33, ILO C87/C105, eIDAS, ESIGN, UETA, 民法601, 借地借家法, 利息制限法, 特定商取引法, 電子署名法, Apache-2.0, each w/ official source URL). **Edge-primary** (N1): template **groundedness** = Σ incident clause-citation × disclosed optionality, computed on read, no stored score. **`publish.py`** content-addresses every body to a kotoba IPFS CIDv1 (**byte-identical to `ipfs add --cid-version=1 --raw-leaves`**, anyone may fetch+verify+reuse, Apache-2.0+Charter Rider). **`esign.py`** renders a template → UNSIGNED `com.etzhayyim.esign.envelope` + verifies signature structure (roster + anti-tamper + WebAuthn alg) + fires `completedEvent`; the member signs client-side (**no-server-key**, ADR-2605231525). **8 gates**: G1 commons-NEVER-the-practice-of-law (no advice/opinion/representation/enforceability-cert; UPL structurally excluded; citations are DISCLOSED facts not verdicts N3) · G2 edge-primary · G3 non-adjudicating · G4 public-venue+open-license+content-addressed · G5 sourcing-honest (unbound clauses surfaced) · G6 Murakumo-only · G7 outward-gated (live legal-corpus binding + IPFS pin/IPNS) · G8 no-server-key. Lexicons `com.etzhayyim.hinagata.{template,clause,statuteCitation}` + reused `esign.*`; pure-stdlib pywasm component (`analyze`/`datoms`/`coverage`/`envelope`) + `validate.py`/`maturity.py` + **33 tests green** (incl. CID-parity + no-server-key invariant). **Expanded over 22 `/loop` waves (PR #1649) → 51 templates / 46 clauses / 132 statutes / 19 jurisdictions / 32 concepts / 10 languages / 619 縁; all 6 legal systems; the 8 core clauses globally grounded; validator 0 errors / 0 warnings; all 10 ontology edge kinds exercised.** | accepted | 2026-06-11 |\n| [2606111900](./2606111900-cc-wet-direct-datom-ingest-no-parquet.md) | **CC WET direct datom-native ingest — parquet を入力ワイヤからも排除** — answers 「parquet ではなく kotoba datomic, ipfs で永続化したい」. 監査: 永続化は最初から Datom log + IPFS (ADR-2605312345) で parquet は at-rest に無いが、`cc.ingest` の入力ワイヤが parquet 専用だった。Decision: `70-tools/scripts/cc-direct-ingest/ingest_wet.py` (pure-stdlib) — CC 公開 WET を有界 HTTP ストリーミング (multi-member gzip 増分デコード、`--max-pages` で切断) → 行境界チャンク → `cc/chunk/*` datoms を `datomic.transact` で `cc:2026-12:chunks` に直書き (決定的 subject = 冪等) → `--reindex` で BM25 再構築 → `search.web` ヒット。**crawler ではない** (ADR-2606012300 \"no crawler by design\" 維持、ソースは CC 公開アーカイブのみ)。live e2e: CC-MAIN-2025-47 実ページ ingest (chunk 137 + bm25 30,507 terms) → commit + 全 6 index root block が Kubo に実在 (`dag get` 可読) → `search.web` が実 CC ページにヒット。15 unit tests green。**実測で server R0 read-path 壁を発見**: ~30k datoms で cc.status 325s / search.web 333s (リクエスト毎 full-graph cold load) — kotoba read-path resident cache / 増分 index が R1 前提。Deferred: authority leg は WAT/webgraph 待ち、semantic leg は既存 embed パス、大規模は Rust `cc.ingest.wet` endpoint (R1)、cold-put fire-and-forget のディスク監視前提 (06-03 disk-full 14,436 silent fail の前科)。 | accepted | 2026-06-11 |\n| [2606111800](./2606111800-donation-media-fiat-inkind-onramp-crypto-allowlist.md) | **Donation-media expansion — fiat in-kind + non-custodial fiat on-ramp (Tier-1 amendment of ADR-2605172100) + curated crypto-asset allowlist** — answers 「donation としては fiat や asset もありにしたい」 + the founder's 「私も日本円でサーバー代を払う形で donation している」. Three media, ONE amendment. **§A fiat IN-KIND** (paying the mission's server/cloud/domain/hardware bills direct to the vendor, in fiat, for the mission) = **recognition only, NO amendment** — no money flows to etzhayyim, identical in form to in-kind COMPUTE donation (ADR-2606012100); new lexicon `com.etzhayyim.give.infrastructureDonationAttestation` (non-titheable, imputed-valued via toritate, aggregate/no-PII, no quid-pro-quo). The founder's actual ongoing donation, now recordable. **§B direct fiat INFLOW** = **Tier-1 amendment** of ADR-2605172100, permitted ONLY in the **NON-CUSTODIAL, immediately-USDC-settling, donor-PII-free, donation-purpose** form — preserving the exact custody/freeze property the no-fiat rule protects (priority-conformance attestation passes: equal on every load-bearing invariant, stronger on mission reach); **CUSTODIAL fiat** (holds an etzhayyim balance / retains donor PII / can freeze, incl. `com.etzhayyim.apps.stripe.*`) is **NON-conformant and REMAINS PROHIBITED** — honest about its own boundary. Ratified Council Lv7+ unanimity (founder 1/1). **§C curated crypto-asset allowlist** (ETH/WETH + USDC/USDT/DAI) held as-is, per-asset tithe = Tier-2 parameter (on-chain, no amendment). Donation-only PURPOSE enum unchanged (no purchase/subscription/tip); 10% tithe + non-profit/ad-free/no-server-key untouched. Surfaces: lexicon + worker `DONATION_POLICY.media` (4 new) + `/donate` cards + DONATE.md + deps.toml payment clarification + root CLAUDE.md Payment row. | accepted | 2026-06-11 |\n| [2606111700](./2606111700-public-sponsor-donation-solicitation-surfaces.md) | **Public sponsor / donation solicitation surfaces — GitHub Sponsor button (custom-only) + DONATE.md + README + active /donate CTA** — answers 「etzhayyim でも sponsor, donation を募集して」. Adds the PUBLIC-FACING *solicitation* layer the repo lacked (no `.github/FUNDING.yml`, no `DONATE.md`, no README support section) on top of the already-live *declaration* (`/donate` + `/.well-known/donation.json`, ADR-2606012100). **Charter-clean by construction**: the GitHub **Sponsor button uses `custom:`-only URLs** pointing at the on-chain donate page — every fiat platform key (`github`/`patreon`/`open_collective`/`ko_fi`/`liberapay`) left blank because fiat processors are prohibited (ADR-2605172100); solicitation is **benefit-free** (no quid-pro-quo tiers, no per-donor leaderboard — anti-class G4; soliciting for etzhayyim's own activity is 案内 not advertising, ADR-2605192115 §1.2); **NO on-chain address fabricated** (the live `donation.json` stays the single SoT — surfaces say \"pending Council + Base L2 testnet\"); 10% tithe unchanged (90/10 `TitheRouter` auto-split). Surfaces: `.github/FUNDING.yml` (custom-only) + root `DONATE.md` (how-to-give) + README \"Support\" section + apex Worker `DONATION_POLICY.solicitation` block (`open:true`, `grantsBenefit:false`, `tiers:\"none\"`, `leaderboard:\"none\"`) + a benefit-free \"Sponsor on GitHub\" card on `/donate` (cookie-free/no-JS). Contrast motive: `666ghj/MiroFish` is funded by corporate incubation + user-borne paid Zep Cloud/LLM API — the model etzhayyim inverts. ZERO invariant amendments (purely additive public-proof + 募集 copy). | accepted | 2026-06-11 |\n| [2606111500](./2606111500-hakoniwa-forward-simulation-observatory.md) | **hakoniwa 箱庭 — forward-simulation observatory (synthetic-persona swarm; Tier-B actor R0)** — answers *「`666ghj/MiroFish` のような群体知能で未来予測する actor は etzhayyim にあるか?」* (was: no — entity-as-actor mirrors are STATIC, mitooshi 見通し only SCORES, the Shibuya digital-twin is PHYSICAL not social). hakoniwa is the missing generative layer: the **charter-clean inversion** of a MiroFish-class engine that runs a CONTAINED miniature world (箱庭) of **FICTIONAL latent personas** forward via Friedkin-Johnsen opinion dynamics (K-replica ensemble, deterministic `sha256`-seeded jitter — no `Math.random`) and reads out a **DISTRIBUTION over possible futures** routed to RESILIENCE/preparedness; the generative front-end that **feeds mitooshi** (produces the distributions mitooshi scores leak-free) and serves sonae/kazaori. Authorized by ADR-2606111400 (synthetic-persona carve-in). **8 gates**: G1 synthetic-personas-only (`:persona/synthetic true`, no PII, real persons unrepresentable — refused at load by `world.assert_synthetic`) · G2 distribution-only (`:forecast/point-asserted` structurally false, NO point field; 非終末論) · G3 non-steering (resilience-only use enum; tra