ubstance decomposition; microbial hydrocarbon biosynthesis + nuclear fusion conditional permission; commercial extraction + fission absolute prohibition retained** — CONSTITUTIONAL AMENDMENT to ADR-2605261100 §G4 + §G5 (Council Lv7+ unanimity to amend; founder Lv7+ proposes, full Council ratifies post-Bootstrap-Seat-2-5-RFP-close 2026-06-19+). Decomposes the conflated G4 (no nuclear) + G5 (no fossil) absolute bans into 5 independent constitutional gates **D1..D5**: D1 Dependency (§1.6 中間排除 — no commercial extractive / state-licensed fuel-cycle / third-party fuel-supply dependency), D2 Multi-gen waste hazard bound (≤100 yr default; intermediate-level case-by-case Council Lv7+; >1,000 yr categorically excluded; atmospheric CO₂ excluded unless D3 satisfied), D3 Closed-loop carbon (net atmospheric Δ ≤ 0 annual; combustion carbon MUST originate from atmospheric CO₂ within prior 10 yr — geological fossil categorically fails), D4 Proliferation hygiene (no weapons-grade fissile material HEU>20%/separated-Pu/U-233; dual-use LEU ≤1 t / Li-6 ≤100 kg / tritium ≤10 kg with Council Lv6+ ≥3 attestation per acquisition), D5 Open-hardware (Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider for all firmware + strain genomes via OpenMTA + plasma diagnostics + control firmware). **§2.2 NEWLY PERMITTED — microbial hydrocarbon biosynthesis**: cyanobacteria (e.g., *Synechocystis* sp. PCC 6803) or engineered photosynthetic organisms fixing atmospheric CO₂ → alkanes via acyl-ACP-decarbonylase pathway, in religious-corp-owned open-hardware photobioreactors on LANDS parcels. Conditions: `carbonSourceAttestation` Lexicon + atmospheric-CO₂-only feedstock (no fossil flue gas) + bioreactor open-hardware + strain open-genome OpenMTA + BSL-1/2 + ≥2 kill-switches + religious-corp-internal use + stationary-combustion-only (transport actors UNCHANGED electric-battery) + ≤10 t/yr cap through R3 + annual `silenHydrocarbonReview` net-zero mass-balance Council Lv6+ ≥3. **§2.3 NEWLY PERMITTED CONDITIONAL — nuclear fusion**: prefe