d). | proposed | 2026-05-26 |\n| [2605262900](./2605262900-toritate-accounting-audit-tier-b-actor-r0.md) | **toritate (執帳) — non-profit religious-corp accounting + audit substrate Tier-B actor R0 charter** — Second-priority gap-closure actor (sibling of chigiri ADR-2605262700; gap audit row 2 = 会計+監査). 任意団体 internal accounting + audit substrate at `did:web:toritate.etzhayyim.com` (`20-actors/toritate/`). Aggregates on-chain TitheRouter + Public Fund Safe + Council Safe + Land Registry transactions into transparent reports. **Constitutional tetrad**: (1) 100% on-chain transparency G3 + G4 — no off-chain primary ledger; (2) UPL-equivalent G5 — no tax advice / no accounting opinion; (3) NO commercial accounting software G8 — QuickBooks / Xero / FreeAgent / Wave / FreshBooks / Sage / Zoho Books PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e) + §2(c); (4) NO payroll G12 — volunteer ≠ employee per Liberation Ladder L0..L6 (`ledgerEntry.category` enum DELIBERATELY excludes payroll/wage/salary/bonus/commission). **6 Pregel cells** (R0 path-reserved): tithe_accounting / public_fund_accounting / council_compensation / steward_subsistence_accounting / transaction_ledger / annual_audit_report. **5 Lexicons** under `com.etzhayyim.toritate.*`: financialAttestation (G10 publishedDonorPii enum excludes verbatim-donor-names) + ledgerEntry (G12 structural payroll-exclusion) + annualReport (G6 ≥3 Council Lv6+ + G9 ≥2 IPFS pin) + auditObservation (severity enum; critical = halt cell + chigiri.disputeMediation escalation) + externalAuditorEngagement (G5 UPL boundary; Public Fund Safe contract CID + opinionDocumentCid is external auditor's, NOT modified). **12 gates G1..G12** + **12 non-goals N1..N12**. **4-phase R0→R3**: R0 this commit / R1 post-Bootstrap-Council 3 core cells + monthly summaries / R2 post-R1 + 30-day public objection +3 cells + first annual report CY 2026 / R3 post-R2 + Council Lv7+ unanimity + ≥1 annual audit; external auditor engagement framework battle-tested (e.g., US 501(c)(3) eq-det opinion enabling chigiri.taxReceipt US routing). Cross-actor with chigiri (tax_receipt 2-way / stewardLaborAttestation read / ipLicenseClaim disbursement). Read-only on financial chain (G11) — TitheRouter + Safes own approval. | proposed | 2026-05-26 |\n| [2605263900](./2605263900-public-data-open-government-ipfs-ingestion.md) | **Global open-government-data ingestion (open-data portals / parliament / budget / procurement / statistics) via IPFS-pinned DataLad subdatasets — sibling of ADR-2605262400 + ADR-2605262800 + ADR-2605263800** — adds the `gov/` bucket family: `open-data/<jurisdiction>/` (data.gov-class) + `parliament/<jurisdiction>/` (議事録 / Hansard / OEIL / Congressional Record) + `budget/<jurisdiction>/` (USAspending / national budgets) + `procurement/<jurisdiction>/` (TED / SAM.gov / 政府調達情報) + `statistics/<source>/` (Eurostat / OECD.Stat / WB / IMF / UN). **5 sensor families** under `kotodama.organism.sensors.gov.*`: gov_open_data_sensor / gov_parliament_sensor / gov_budget_sensor / gov_procurement_sensor / gov_statistics_sensor. **License ladder**: Tier-A dominates (US public-domain / OGL v3.0 / EU re-use Decision 2011/833 / Étalab v2.0 / JP CC-BY 4.0 政府標準利用規約 / Datenlizenz Deutschland Zero / Eurostat free re-use / OECD ToU / WB CC-BY 4.0 / IMF open-data / UN free use); Tier-B for sources with attribution-mandatory restrictions; **Tier-C EMPTY** — GovWin IQ / Bloomberg Government / Politico Pro / E&E News Pro / FiscalNote / CQ Roll Call Pro **CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED** per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). **CN data flagged §2(g)** state-aligned scrutiny (parallel to ADR-2605262800 CN NPC treatment). **5 training recipes** at `70-tools/baien-moemoekyun-train/recipes/gov/`: gov-civic-literacy-foundations-r1 / gov-budget-transparency-r1 / gov-procurement-transparency-r1 / gov-parliament-procedural-r1 / gov-statistics-foundations-r1. **2 new Kaizen rules** R14 (stale-gov-pin) + R15 (parliament-cadence-drift >30d for active legislatures). **12 gates G1..G12** + **12 non-goals N1..N12**. **4-wave delivery**: W0 this ADR / W1 = US data.gov + UK data.gov.uk + JP data.go.jp + e-Stat + US Congress.gov + UK Hansard + JP 国会会議録 + Eurostat + WB + 5 sensors + 2 recipes / W2 = EU + FR + DE open-data + OECD + IMF + USAspending + EU TED + US SAM.gov / W3 = EU OEIL + DE Bundestag + FR Assemblée + EU FTS + JP 政府調達 + UK Contracts Finder + UN Data + 3 recipes + ossekai + toritate wiring / W4 = CN §2(g) flag + cross-actor manabi/chigiri/baien-distill wiring. **Powers**: ossekai (state-function-routing-around evidence aggregate publication) + toritate (recipient-vendor cross-ref / anti-related-party) + chigiri (Charter §1.12 state-function-routing-around evidence base) + manabi (civic-literacy primary-source curriculum L4) + baien-distill (civic-reasoning specialist). | proposed | 2026-05-26 |\n| [2605263800](./2605263800-public-data-corporate-disclosure-ipfs-ingestion.md) | **Global corporate-disclosure ingestion (SEC EDGAR / EDINET / Companies House / GLEIF LEI / OpenCorporates / regional registries) via IPFS-pinned DataLad subdatasets — extends ADR-2605262400; powers ossekai (ADR-2605264000) / toritate (ADR-2605262900) / chigiri (ADR-2605262700) / baien-distill financial-literacy specialist** — sibling of ADR-2605262400 + ADR-2605262800; adds the `corp/` bucket family: `registries/<jurisdiction>/` + `disclosures/<jurisdiction>/<form>/` + `lei/gleif/` + `cross-juris/opencorporates/` + `ownership/<source>/` + `filing-events/<source>/`. **5 sensor families** under `kotodama.organism.sensors.corp.*`: corp_registry_sensor / corp_disclosure_sensor / lei_sensor / corp_ownership_sensor / corp_filing_event_sensor. **License ladder**: Tier-A dominates (SEC EDGAR US public-domain 17 CFR 200 / JP EDINET 金融庁 open / UK Companies House OGL v3.0 / GLEIF CC0 / SEDAR+ open ToU / ASIC bulk on data.gov.au CC-BY / DE Unternehmensregister accessible bulk / FR INFOGREFFE/RNCS Étalab v2.0 portions); Tier-B for OpenCorporates open-data fork CC-BY-SA `-tierB-