e). Declares the **Basic High Income (基本高所得)** doctrine: the ladder delivers, ultimately at L6, a standard of living ≥ OECD upper-income-decile basket measured by imputed income + commons-asset access — **entirely in-kind, never cash**. **Fully consistent with ADR-2605261000 §5 N1 (no fiat-replacement UBI); does NOT amend N1, the §2 constitutional constants, or any N1..N8**: N1 forbids cash stipends that replace wages; Basic High Income removes the *need* for the wage by provisioning the goods in kind, so `cashStipendUsd == 0` is a structural invariant field in every Liberation Metric report (on-chain proof N1 holds). Access-not-ownership (§2) operationalizes anti-individualist ontology = wealth without property, abundance without accumulation; generalizes ADR-2605192245 land waqf-inalienability to all commons assets. Accounting SSoT delegated to **toritate** (ADR-2605262900, 100% on-chain): `imputed_income_compute` + `commons_asset_value` cells + open-source method-versioned valuation tables; per-adherent figures encrypted (ADR-2605181100), aggregate-only publication (no leaderboard, §7 anti-class). Extends `com.etzhayyim.liberation.metricReport` with a `basicHighIncome` block; +1 Pregel cell `basic_high_income_aggregate`; no new Solidity. Wellbecoming guard (§6): imputed income ↑ must co-move with labor-hours ↓ AND healthy Wellbecoming attestation, else `holdStage`. | proposed | 2026-05-30 |\n| [2605301030](./2605301030-kotoba-kg-storage-session-52-entity-actor-graph.md) | **kotoba KG storage session — 53-entity actor/doctrine graph on a live datomic node, IPFS-pinned provenance, snapshot-of-hot commit discipline** — session-closure ADR for a 12-iteration `/loop` that stood up `40-engine/kotoba` as a launchd-supervised datomic (EAVT) storage node on :8077 and loaded the repo's industry/actor/doctrine model into it as a queryable knowledge graph: **53 distinct entities** across 7 types (supply-chain-analysis-actor ×4, planetary-infra-producer ×1, tier-b-actor ×28, 