ology (no \"individual\" to protect via anonymity) + voluntary-covenant model (Acts 5 Ananias/Sapphira = concealment from the body, not property). **Consequences documented for Council**: legal exposure (APPI/GDPR/CCPA vs publishing non-member email/PII/IP), himotoki contradiction (limited to ingress by §4(2)), innocent-fourth-party cascade in inbound email (sharpest Wellbecoming tension), self-leak risk (mitigated by §4), intended chilling effect (\"seek another salvation\"). Agent's \"transparency for power / privacy for persons\" proposal considered + **rejected by founder** (retained under Alternatives). Depends on ADR-2605192100 (§0.4/§1.12/§1.13/Wellbecoming/反個人主義) + ADR-2605181100 (amended) + ADR-2605262130 + ADR-2605231525. | proposed | 2026-05-31 |\n| [2605311500](./2605311500-kami-genesis-physics-validation-and-isaac-clean-room-surface.md) | **kami-genesis physics maturation — PlanarChain articulation + clean-room isaacsim.core.api surface + analytical/conservation-law validation + G5 Isaac-reference scorecard** — physics-engine loop (2026-05-31; re-issued from 2605310100 after that id was concurrently committed by the Covenant Transparency ADR e1d5d9d92). (1) PlanarChain = 3rd `World` articulation topology (N≥3 serial revolute) over the RNEA+CRBA+LDLᵀ planar solver; `detect_topology` reads a serial revolute chain from URDF (`70-tools/e7m-sim/scenes/arm3/arm3.urdf`); N-DOF `step`/`set_joint_torques`/`joint_positions`/`joint_velocities`/`link_state`/`reset_to_zero`; `World::jacobian()` → `planar_chain_link_jacobian`. (2) `kami-genesis/src/isaac_api.rs` = clean-room `isaacsim.core.api` mirror (`IsaacWorld` + `ArticulationView` + `ArticulationViewMut::set_joint_efforts`); single-env; **no NVIDIA library/header/binary linked** (§2(b) N1..N9 NEVER); batched/sensor surfaces not yet implemented. (3) Validation = analytical + conservation law: uniform-rod α=3g/(2L) + ω=√(3g/L) within 2%, 2-link energy drift <5%/3 s; kami-dec heat Σ conserved <0.2% (decay=0) + mono