n-factory-r0-kami-engine-kotoba-4d-bim.md) | **giemon factory R0 — whole-plant layout + 建材 + 4D 建築手順, designed in kami-engine + kotoba Datomic** — answers the founder's ask to build the giemon FACTORY itself (layout, hardware, building materials, construction procedure), entirely in kami-engine + kotoba, by composing three shipped precedents (kami-app-giemon products + kami-app-shibuya environment-build + kabitori EDN→SBOM→kotoba pilot). Three modeled layers: **(1) building shell (建材)** — 80m×50m single-bay plant, perimeter walls + inspection partition + 8-column grid + 3 roof trusses as `Obstacle::Aabb` + CAD geometry (`factory.scene.json`, shibuya-`Scene` lineage extended); **(2) production hardware (設備)** — CNC/lathe/CMM/benches/conveyor/racks/packing + **4 giemon arm6 work-cells** (fixed-base `Articulation3d`, PD work-cycle) + **2 four-DOF AGV carts** (shibuya floating-base path, collide vs walls/columns/machines); **(3) construction procedure (建築手順)** — the new modeling: `construction.edn` 13-step 4D sequence (depends-on/consumes/duration/reveals) replayed by `run_giemon_factory_build_v1` in `:seq` order. **v2 expansion** (founder ask \"もっと電気・水道・ガス・配線・照明・外部動線…全て設計, 実装配線, sbom に。原材料/市販品/建材も\"): full **routed MEP** (`utilities` 12網 色分け配管/配線 = 電気busway+幹線+分岐 / 圧空ring / data / 給水 / 給湯 / 排水 / 雨水 / ガス / 消火栓, `service_nodes`引込=受電キュービクル+変圧器/受水槽+ポンプ/ガス整圧器/通信, `fixtures`=高天井LED24+誘導灯) + **外構/外部動線** (`site_*` = 車道/トラックヤード/駐車/構内道/歩道/メッシュフェンス/電動門/外灯6/車止め/植栽/看板) + **原材料** (生コン/アスコン/砕石/エポキシ/シーリング/鉄骨塗装). kotoba datoms: `building.edn` (**72 parts, groups A-L**) → `kg/claim/part/*` + CycloneDX SBOM; `construction.edn` (**23-step** 4D: 引込→地中埋設→基礎→鉄骨→屋根→外装→電気配線→圧空/data→照明→床→衛生→消防→機械→コンベア→ロボット→外構舗装→動線→外灯/フェンス→植栽→通電/通水/通ガス試運転) → `kg/claim/step/*` with depends-on/consumes as **entity refs** (critical path via VAET). `kotoba_gen.py` cross-checks seq-contiguity + DAG-acyclicity + consumes/reveals resolution, bakes `construction.order.json`. New crate `kami-app-giemon-factory` (scene.rs