ted secure checkout, MEMBER-principal (corrects scope-3 from 代理-purchase): member is buyer (G14) + signs each payment (G15 no-server-key) + encrypted PII (G9), so §1.3 holds without Lv7+ amendment). 13 gates; Murakumo-only (G5); kotoba-EAVT-native (G6). **Honest**: R0 design + data-model + simulation; no live retailer integration (`:representative` seed); **Ring 2 代理-purchase does NOT ship at R0** (R3-gated); scraping gated (G10/G11), not run live; per-provider API ToS for data-only-without-affiliate use unverified. Depends on ADR-2605192100 + 2605192115 + 2605192200 + 2605215000 + 2605262130 + 2605312345 + 2605301020 + 2605301036 + 2605302357 + 2605302000 + 2605231500 + 2605261215 + 2605252400 + 2606010200 + 2605312500 + 2605312030. | proposed | 2026-06-01 |\n| [2606012400](./2606012400-session-close-kotoba-hybrid-web-search.md) | **Session close — kotoba hybrid web search (BM25 + PageRank + RRF) shipped** — documentation-only closure for the 2026-06-01 session answering *「google のような global な検索は kotoba server で設計実装されているか」*. Shipped the hybrid retrieval stack (ADR-2606012300) in two increments: **(1)** the three missing legs (`bm25`/`pagerank`/`fusion` pure-Rust modules) + fixed the inert IVF query path (was `let _ = ivf;`) + `com.etzhayyim.apps.kotoba.search.web` RRF endpoint; **(2)** precompute wiring — corpus-global BM25 build + outlink-edge ingestion (`CcPageIngestor::ingest_links_dir_datoms` parses the parquet `outlinks` column → `cc/link/to` edges) + PageRank pass, all auto-run at end of `cc.ingest` + on-demand via `search.reindex`. **105 kotoba-ingest + 22 cc_xrpc tests green**; default + cc-parquet build green. kotoba submodule `f14cef2`; root `3e47cb7ab` (path-limited commit avoiding a concurrent background loop's staged files). Loop stopped: the remaining gap (real link-graph data at scale) is dataset-sourcing, not a buildable code increment. Authoritative design = ADR-2606012300. | active | 2026-06-01 |\n| [2606012300](./2606012300-kotoba-hybrid-web-search-bm25-pagerank-rrf.md) | **kotoba hybrid web search — BM25 + PageRank + RRF fusion over the Datom log** — answers *「google のような global な検索は kotoba server で設計実装されているか」*: it was only *partial* (semantic/IVF + RAG present; **no keyword search, IVF query path inert via `let _ = ivf;`, no authority ranking**). Adds the three missing Google-shaped legs, all pure-Rust + datom-native (no external search engine / vector DB; Murakumo-only embed — substrate invariants ADR-2605262130/2605312345/2605215000 preserved). 3 new `kotoba-ingest` modules: **`bm25.rs`** (Okapi BM25 lexical inverted index `k1=1.2 b=0.75`, CJK-aware bigram tokenizer so JP CC text is searchable with no segmenter; `cc/bm25/*` quad persistence — `n`/`avgdl`/per-doc `len`/per-term `df`+packed `postings`) + **`pagerank.rs`** (pure power-iteration link-authority over `cc:2026-12:links`, dangling-mass redistribution Σ=1, damping 0.85, `cc/rank/score` Float datoms; `normalized_score`/`top`) + **`fusion.rs`** (Reciprocal Rank Fusion `RRF_K=60` — scale-free across unbounded BM25 / cosine∈[-1,1] / PageRank∈(0,1] — + min-max weighted-linear fuser with authority boost). Server (`kotoba-server::cc_xrpc`): **fixed the dead IVF fallback** — new `semantic_ranking()` reads persisted `cc/ivf/cluster` + centroids and calls `IvfIndex::search` probing `nprobe` nearest centroids (`cc_search` now uses it; brute-force only when no index) + **new endpoint `com.etzhayyim.apps.kotoba.search.web`** (GET, operator-auth) fusing lexical+semantic+authority via RRF with **graceful degrade** (no `KOTOBA_EMBED_URL` → lexical+authority; empty link graph → drop authority leg) + weights `wLex`/`wSem`/`wAuth` (1.0/1.0/0.5) + per-signal rank breakdown. **Precompute wired (2nd increment)**: corpus-global BM25 build pass + `CcPageIngestor::ingest_links_dir_datoms`/`read_page_links` (parse `outlinks` `List<Utf8>` column → `cc/link/to` edges into `cc:links`) + PageRank pass — all auto-run at end of `cc.ingest` and on-demand via **`com.etzhayyim.apps.kotoba.search.reindex`** (POST); `web_search` now prefers the persisted `cc/bm25/*` index; `cc.status` reports `bm25_terms`/`link_edges`/`pagerank_nodes`. **105 kotoba-ingest (incl. cc-parquet) + 22 cc_xrpc tests green**, builds in default + cc-parquet (pre-existing `server::tests` env-var ordering flake unrelated, confirmed on baseline). **HONEST R0**: edge extraction needs an `outlinks` list column in the pages parquet — scalar-`outlink_count`-only datasets yield no edges (empty link graph → authority leg dropped, logged at ingest); full-rebuild reindex (no incremental); **no crawler** (ingests Common Crawl); operator-auth gated (not a public ad-supported index — Charter ad-free/donation-only). Depends on ADR-2605262130 + 2605312345 + 2605215000 + 2605250006. | accepted | 2026-06-01 |\n| [2606012600](./2606012600-watatsuna-submarine-cable-knowledge-graph-and-watatsumi-cable-laying-robotics.md) | **watatsuna 綿津綱 — world submarine-cable network knowledge graph (kotoba EAVT) + watatsumi 綿津見 cable-laying robotics** — answers *「海底ケーブルのデータベースは kotoba server / actor として設計されているか? etzhayyim.com に actor 表示できるか? 必要なら敷設 robotics も設計」*. Audit found only legacy `etzhayyim` cable lexicons (Kotoba/Datomic-era record schemas), no actor, no kotoba dataset, no ADR. **(a) New Tier-B observation actor `20-actors/watatsuna/`** (same-root sibling of watatsumi 綿津見; observation face ↔ watatsumi operation face) datafies the planet's cable network into the **kotoba Datom log** and surfaces chokepoint single-point-of-failure concentration **routed to redundancy + faster repair** — a **resilience map, NEVER a target-list** (G2; watatsumi N8 + Charter Rider §2(d)). Vocab `00-contracts/schemas/submarine-cable-ontology.kotoba.edn` (`:cable/* :station/*`+`:chokepoint` `:cable.link/* :cable.seg/*`+`:traverses` `:cable.fault/*` as-of history); seed `data/seed-cable-graph.kotoba.edn` (**14 real public systems** JUPITER/FASTER/PLCN/MAREA/Dunant/Grace-Hopper/2Africa/SMW3-4/ADC/SJC/Equiano/Bifrost/A